WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.534 --> 00:00:02.867
(sad music)

00:00:05.320 --> 00:00:06.153
- [Officer] I know this is hard,

00:00:06.153 --> 00:00:07.180
but I need to ask you some questions

00:00:07.180 --> 00:00:08.770
about what happened.

00:00:08.770 --> 00:00:09.963
- He tied my hands.

00:00:11.120 --> 00:00:13.920
He said if I screamed, he'd kill me.

00:00:13.920 --> 00:00:15.800
- No signs of forced entry.

00:00:15.800 --> 00:00:17.290
Doors and windows were locked.

00:00:17.290 --> 00:00:18.500
No DNA.

00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:21.600
Not a single neighbor
saw or heard a thing.

00:00:21.600 --> 00:00:24.370
- He brought a blindfold
but nothing to tie her with.

00:00:24.370 --> 00:00:26.320
Would a shoelace even hold her?

00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:30.340
- You think Marie made up the attack?

00:00:30.340 --> 00:00:32.170
- I'm pretty positive that it happened.

00:00:32.170 --> 00:00:35.000
- Pretty positive or positive?

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:36.667
- They just kept asking
me the same question.

00:00:36.667 --> 00:00:38.340
"How come your story doesn't add up?"

00:00:38.340 --> 00:00:39.403
I wanted to go home.

00:00:41.130 --> 00:00:42.660
- I don't have a victim here.

00:00:42.660 --> 00:00:43.533
It's bogus.

00:00:43.533 --> 00:00:44.503
She made it up.

00:00:47.665 --> 00:00:50.670
(intense music)

00:00:50.670 --> 00:00:53.200
- [Reporter] We are on the
scene of a violent attack.

00:00:53.200 --> 00:00:55.360
Police say a masked assailant broke in

00:00:55.360 --> 00:00:57.330
while the victim was sleeping.

00:00:57.330 --> 00:01:01.242
- He said, "You need to be
more protective of yourself."

00:01:01.242 --> 00:01:02.330
(camera flash clicking)

00:01:02.330 --> 00:01:03.540
- Black mask.

00:01:03.540 --> 00:01:04.590
Bindings.

00:01:04.590 --> 00:01:06.180
Early morning attacks.

00:01:06.180 --> 00:01:07.901
- I think he's done this before.

00:01:07.901 --> 00:01:09.440
(gun firing)

00:01:09.440 --> 00:01:10.273
- Aurora.

00:01:10.273 --> 00:01:11.400
18 months ago.

00:01:11.400 --> 00:01:12.233
Intruder.

00:01:12.233 --> 00:01:14.623
Black mask, backpack,
tied her up, took photos.

00:01:15.810 --> 00:01:18.476
To date, he's not been caught.

00:01:18.476 --> 00:01:21.143
(intense music)

00:01:21.980 --> 00:01:23.290
- You see the pattern.

00:01:23.290 --> 00:01:24.270
There's a rape.

00:01:24.270 --> 00:01:25.950
New evidence, new leads,

00:01:25.950 --> 00:01:29.640
and then one by one they
dry up until he hits again.

00:01:29.640 --> 00:01:32.082
- This one we're figuring out on our own.

00:01:32.082 --> 00:01:34.160
(intense music)

00:01:34.160 --> 00:01:36.750
- What if he knows stations
don't talk to each other?

00:01:36.750 --> 00:01:39.570
As long as he only hits once in each town.

00:01:39.570 --> 00:01:40.780
- You could have detectives

00:01:40.780 --> 00:01:42.510
from eight different departments

00:01:42.510 --> 00:01:44.670
investigating eight identical rapes

00:01:44.670 --> 00:01:47.293
with no clue they're all
chasing the same guy.

00:01:48.710 --> 00:01:49.980
- Victims are all over the map.

00:01:49.980 --> 00:01:51.640
Old, young, different races.

00:01:51.640 --> 00:01:52.800
So he doesn't have a type.

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:54.463
- Sure he does, women who live alone.

00:01:55.670 --> 00:01:56.870
- [Officer] This guy is out there

00:01:56.870 --> 00:01:59.240
preying on the most
vulnerable women he can find.

00:01:59.240 --> 00:02:01.111
Where is the outrage?

00:02:01.111 --> 00:02:03.778
(intense music)

00:02:10.240 --> 00:02:12.280
This is not something people get over.

00:02:12.280 --> 00:02:15.463
This is something they
carry with them forever.

00:02:15.463 --> 00:02:18.130
(intense music)

00:02:22.766 --> 00:02:24.960
- Even with people that you can trust,

00:02:24.960 --> 00:02:27.650
if the truth is inconvenient,

00:02:27.650 --> 00:02:28.750
they don't believe it.

